return ['domain'=>'zinn-migrate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-migrate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:49:02+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:49:02+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Migrate'=>'Zinn® Migrate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate','Packages this WordPress site — files and database — into one archive that Zinn Digital® can pull in, for hosts we cannot reach any other way. Install it on the site you are LEAVING, press one button, and paste the link into your Zinn® migration.'=>'Yana tattara wannan rukunin yanar gizo na WordPress — fayiloli da ma\'ajiyar bayanai — zuwa cikin rumbun adana bayanai guda ɗaya wanda Zinn Digital® zai iya ɗauka, don masu masaukin yanar gizo da ba za mu iya samun dama ta wata hanya ba. Shigar da shi a rukunin yanar gizon da kuke bari, danna maballin guda ɗaya, sannan liƙa hanyar haɗin yanar gizon a cikin ƙaurarku ta Zinn®.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Move this site to Zinn®'=>'Matsar da wannan shafi zuwa Zinn®','Move to Zinn®'=>'Matsar zuwa Zinn®','You do not have permission to do this.'=>'Ba ku da izinin yin wannan.','This packages everything on this site — its files and its database — into one archive, and gives you a private link to it. Paste that link into your migration on Zinn® and we will pull the site across. Nothing here is sent anywhere until you choose to share the link.'=>'Wannan yana tattara duk abin da ke kan wannan rukunin yanar gizon — fayilolinsa da ma\'ajiyar bayanansa — zuwa cikin rumbun adana bayanai guda ɗaya, kuma yana ba ku hanyar haɗi ta sirri zuwa gare shi. Manna wannan hanyar haɗin yanar gizon a cikin ƙaurarku a kan Zinn® kuma za mu jawo rukunin yanar gizon. Ba a aika wani abu a nan ko\'ina ba har sai kun zaɓi raba hanyar haɗin yanar gizon.','You may not need this. If your old host gives you FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk or DirectAdmin, Zinn® can fetch the site directly with those details and you can skip this plugin entirely — it is faster and there is nothing left behind afterwards. Use this when none of those are available to you.'=>'Wataƙila ba kwa buƙatar wannan. Idan tsohon uwar garkenku yana ba ku FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk ko DirectAdmin, Zinn® na iya ɗauko rukunin yanar gizon kai tsaye tare da waɗannan bayanan kuma za ku iya tsallake wannan manhaja gaba ɗaya — ya fi sauri kuma babu abin da zai bari a baya daga baya. Yi amfani da wannan lokacin da babu ko ɗaya daga cikin waɗannan da ke akwai a gare ku.','Room on this server'=>'Wuri a wannan uwar garken','This server will not tell us how much disk space is free, so we cannot check for you. The package needs roughly %s. If you are not sure there is that much room, ask your host before you build it — a server that runs out of space mid-way takes the site down.'=>'Wannan uwar garken ba za ta gaya mana adadin sararin faifai da ke da \'yanci ba, don haka ba za mu iya bincika muku ba. Kunshin yana buƙatar kusan %s. Idan ba ku da tabbacin akwai sarari mai yawa, tambayi mai masaukin ku kafin ku gina shi — uwar garken da ta ƙarewa sarari a tsakiyar aiki tana saukar da rukunin yanar gizon.','The package needs roughly %1$s and this server has %2$s free.'=>'Kunshin yana buƙatar kusan %1$s kuma wannan uwar garken tana da %2$s kyauta.','Build the package'=>'Gina kunshin','Building…'=>'Ana ginawa…','Now packaging: %1$s. %2$s files so far, %3$s written.'=>'Ana tattarawa yanzu: %1$s. Fayiloli %2$s kawo yanzu, an rubuta %3$s.','your files'=>'Fayilolinku','your database'=>'Rumbun bayananka','Continue'=>'Ci gaba','Cancel and delete'=>'Soke kuma goge','Your package is ready'=>'Fakitin ku ya shirya','Copy this link and paste it into your migration on Zinn®:'=>'Kwafi wannan hanyar haɗin yanar gizo kuma manna shi a cikin ƙauranku akan Zinn®:','Size: %s.'=>'Girma: %s.','Treat this link like a password. Anyone who has it can download your whole site, including your database. We delete the package automatically 24 hours after it was built — delete it yourself as soon as your migration has finished.'=>'Kula da wannan hanyar haɗin kamar kalmar sirri ce. Duk wanda ke da ita zai iya sauke dukkan rukunin yanar gizonku, gami da ma\'ajiyar bayanan ku. Muna share kunshin kai tsaye sa\'o\'i 24 bayan an gina shi — ku goge shi da kanku da zarar an kammala ƙaura.','Delete the package now'=>'Goge fakitin yanzu','Build it again'=>'Sake gina shi','This server does not have PHP’s ZipArchive extension, so we cannot build a package here. Ask your host to enable it, or use the migration form on Zinn® with your FTP or SSH details instead.'=>'Wannan uwar garken ba ta da ƙarin haɓaka na ZipArchive na PHP, don haka ba za mu iya gina kunshi a nan ba. Tambayi mai masaukin ku don ya kunna shi, ko kuma a maimakon haka ku yi amfani da fom ɗin ƙaura a Zinn® tare da bayanan FTP ko SSH na ku.','We could not create a folder inside your uploads directory, so there is nowhere to write the package. Check that wp-content/uploads is writable.'=>'Ba mu iya ƙirƙirar babban fayil a cikin rumbun adana bayanan abubuwan da ka loda ba, don haka babu inda za a rubuta kunshin. Bincika don tabbatar da cewa ana iya rubutu a wp-content/uploads.','There is no package being built. Start one first.'=>'Ba a gina kowane fakiti ba. Fara ɗaya da farko.','We could not open the package file for writing.'=>'Ba mu iya buɗe fayil ɗin kunshin don rubutawa ba.','We could not write the database export.'=>'Ba mu iya rubuta fitarwar ma\'ajiyar bayanai ba.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s','Hide this'=>'Ɓoye wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Bakuncin Zinn® don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, adana bayanan yau da kullum, canja wurin shafi kyauta, da allon sarrafawa da aka gina domin mutanen da ke gudanar da shafuka fiye da daya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwar Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayi kuma sayar da kafaffun shafukan yanar gizo, yankuna da wuraren sanya hanyoyin haɗi, tare da ajiye kuɗin lafiya har sai ɓangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ɗauki mutanen da suka mayar da wannan sana\'ar rayuwarsu','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwar mu ta masu aikin dogaro da kai ta duniya: bincika sama da ayyuka 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu ƙira, masu haɓaka software da ƙwararrun SEO, ko sanya aiki kuma ka bar su su bayar da tayin farashi.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Duba bayanan sakin Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Sabis ɗin ɗaukaka na Zinn® bai bayar da hanyar saukarwa don wannan ɗaukakawa ba. Bincika ko wannan rukunin yanar gizon zai iya samun damar shiga dandalin Zinn®, sannan ku sake gwadawa.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba a iya sauke sabuntawar ba daga sabis ɗin sabuntawa na Zinn® (%s). Sake gwadawa bayan ƴan mintuna.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ɗaukakawar da aka saukar ta gaza a binciken amincinta kuma ba a shigar da ita ba.']];